    "title": "Eugenia Last, what's my daily horoscope today? Aries, keep your promises and it will be rewarding (08/28/25) - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eugenia Last ,\n40 minutes ago CELEBRITIES BORN ON THIS DAY: Armie Hammer, 39; Jason Priestley, 56; Jack Black, 56; Shania Twain, 60. Happy Birthday: Recognize what’s necessary and worthwhile to maintain your lifestyle, reputation and position. Walk away from emotional turmoil, criticism and pressure. Refuse to let what others do influence you. Consider what brings you happiness, safety, security and ease, and reduce your level of stress. Don’t ignore your emotions or agree to something that doesn’t align with your agenda, beliefs or goals. Trust your instincts, and you’ll find the best way forward. Your numbers are 5, 13, 20, 26, 34, 38, 46. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
